nsfer the account ownership to:'=>'Foydalanuvchini o\'zgartirish orqali siz hisob egaligini quyidagiga o\'tkazishga rozilik bildirasiz:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'O‘zgarishlar tarixi','Changing user, please wait'=>'Foydalanuvchi oʻzgartirilmoqda, iltimos kuting','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Agar xat kelmagan bo\'lsa, spam papkasini tekshirib ko\'ring yoki %4$s manzilidan kelgan xatlarni qidiring.','Checkout'=>'Buyurtma berish','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish uchun %s tagacha saytni tanlang.','City'=>'Shahar','Clear API Cache'=>'API keshini tozalash','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Yangilanishlar vaqtincha ma\'lumotlarini tozalash','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bu yerni bosing','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Plagindan anonim ravishda foydalanish uchun bu yerni bosing','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'%s reytingini bergan sharhlarni ko\'rish uchun bosing','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s – mijozimning elektron pochta manzili','Code'=>'Kod','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Mijoz yangi litsenziya sotib olganda %s komissiya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Potensial qaytarishlar uchun 30 kun saqlab qo‘yilishini hisobga olib, biz faqat 30 kundan oshgan komissiya to‘lovlarini amalga oshiramiz.','Communication'=>'Aloqa','Compatible up to'=>'Quyidagicha mos keladi','complete the opt-in'=>'obunani yakunlash','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Tabriklaymiz','Never miss an important update'=>'Muhim yangilanishni hech qachon o\'tkazib yubormang','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'%1$s v%2$s versiyasiga yanginganingiz uchun rahmat!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, ta’limiy kontent va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti haqida ayrim ma’lumotlarni ulashish uchun rozilik bildiring. Bu bizga %s\'ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishga va sizga kerakli vazifalarni yanada yaxshiroq bajarishiga yordam beradi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, ta\'limiy kontent hamda vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo\'yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda ba\'zi asosiy WordPress muhiti ma\'lumotlarini ulashish uchun ro\'yxatdan o\'ting.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Buni o\'tkazib yuborsangiz ham muammo yo\'q! %1$s baribir yaxshi ishlayveradi.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Biz ushbu qo‘shilish imkoniyatini taqdim etdik, shunda siz hech qanday muhim yangilanishni o‘tkazib yubormaysiz va %s vositasini veb-saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishimizda hamda sizga kerakli vazifalarni bajarishda yaxshiroq ishlashiga yordam berasiz.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Biz Freemius tarmoq darajasidagi integratsiyani taqdim etishdan mamnunmiz.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida tarmoqda hali e\'tiboringizni talab qiladigan %s ta sayt aniqlandi.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida litsenziyasi hali faollashtirilmagan %d ta sayt aniqlandi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Agar bu saytlarda %s dan foydalanishni istasangiz, iltimos, litsenziya kalitingizni quyiga kiriting va faollashtirish tugmasini bosing.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Shuningdek, buni hozircha oʻtkazib yuborishingiz va litsenziyani keyinroq %s tarmogʻi darajasidagi Hisob qaydnomasi sahifasida faollashtirishingiz mumkin.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ulangan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Tugatganingizdan so\'ng, %s ni o\'chiring va uni qaytadan faollashtiring.','Contact'=>'Aloqa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiyalar yangilanishlari, o‘quv materiallari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha siz bilan bog‘lanishimizni istasangiz, iltimos, bizga xabar bering:','Contact Support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmati bilan bog\'lanish','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Nogulaylik uchun uzr so\'raymiz va agar bizga imkon bersangiz, yordam berishga tayyormiz.','Contact Us'=>'Biz bilan bog\'laning','Please contact us here'=>'Iltimos, bu yerda biz bilan bog\'laning','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Iltimos, biz bilan quyidagi xabar orqali bog\'laning:','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Contributors'=>'Ishtirokchilar','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'%s ni faollashtirib bo‘lmadi.','Country'=>'Mamlakat','Cron Type'=>'Kron turi','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'API so\'rovlari uchun biz PHP cURL kutubxonasidan foydalanamiz, bu juda keng tarqalgan kutubxona bo\'lib, odatda o\'rnatilgan va sukut bo\'yicha faollashtirilgan bo\'ladi. Afsuski, serveringizda cURL faollashtirilmagan (yoki o\'chirilgan).','data'=>'ma\'lumotlar','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Nosozliklarni tuzatish rejimi muvaffaqiyatli yoqildi va 60 daqiqadan so\'ng avtomatik ravishda o\'chiriladi. Shuningdek, "Stop Debug" havolasini bosish orqali uni erta o\'chirishingiz mumkin.','Date'=>'Sana','Deactivate'=>'Faolsizlantirish','Deactivate the free version'=>'Bepul versiyani faolsizlantirish','Deactivate License'=>'Litsenziyani faolsizlantirish','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Litsenziyangizni faolsizlantirish barcha premium funksiyalarni bloklaydi, lekin litsenziyani boshqa saytda faollashtirish imkonini beradi. Davom etishni xohlayotganingizga aminmisiz?','Deactivation'=>'Faollashtirni bekor qilish','Yes - %s'=>'Ha - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Yuborish va %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'%s ni o\'chirish yoki olib tashlash litsenziyani avtomatik ravishda faolsizlantiradi, uni boshqa saytda ishlatishingiz mumkin bo\'ladi.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Agar vaqtingiz bo\'lsa, iltimos, nima uchun %s ekanligingizni bizga xabar bering','Debug Log'=>'Nosozliklarni tuzatish jurnali','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Nosozliklarni bartaraf etish','delegate'=>'delegat qilish','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Agar uni bossangiz, bu qaror sayt ma\'muriyatiga yuklatiladi.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Sayt administratorlariga o‘tkazish','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Sayt administratorlariga o‘tkazish va davom etish','Delegating, please wait'=>'Delegatsiya qilinmoqda, iltimos kuting','verbDelete'=