at will need attention.Heads up'=>'Diqqat','exclamationHey'=>'Salom','greetingHey %s,'=>'Salom %s,','verbHide'=>'Yashirish','something somebody says when they are thinking about what you have just said.Hmm'=>'Hmm','How to upload and activate?'=>'Qanday qilib yuklab olish va faollashtirish mumkin?','ID'=>'ID','You are already running the %s in a trial mode.'=>'Siz allaqachon %s ni sinov rejimida ishga tushirgansiz.','In %s'=>'%s da','Install Free Version Now'=>'Bepul versiyani hoziroq o‘rnatish','Install Free Version Update Now'=>'Bepoul versiyani o\'rnatish Yangilash Hozir','Install Now'=>'Hozir o\'rnatish','Install Update Now'=>'Yangilanishni hozir oʻrnatish','Plugin installer section titleInstallation'=>'O\'rnatish','installed add-onInstalled'=>'O\'rnatilgan','An automated download and installation of %1$s (paid version) from %2$s will start in %3$s. If you would like to do it manually - click the cancellation button now.'=>'%1$s (pulcha versiyasi) %2$s dan avtomatik yuklab olish va oʻrnatish %3$s dan soʻng boshlanadi. Agar buni qoʻlda bajarishni istasangiz, hozir bekor qilish tugmasini bosing.','The installation process has started and may take a few minutes to complete. Please wait until it is done - do not refresh this page.'=>'O\'rnatish jarayoni boshlandi va yakunlanishi uchun bir necha daqiqa vaqt olishi mumkin. Iltimos, u tugaguncha kuting - bu sahifani yangilamang.','Installing plugin: %s'=>'Plagin o\'rnatilmoqda: %s','Invalid clone resolution action.'=>'Yaroqsiz klonlashnihal qilish amali.','Invalid domain'=>'Yaroqsiz domen','Invalid new user ID or email address.'=>'Yangi foydalanuvchi ID yoki elektron pochta manzili yaroqsiz.','Invalid site details collection.'=>'Sayt tafsilotlari toʻplami yaroqsiz.','Invoice'=>'Hisob-faktura','Is Active'=>'Faol','Keep Sharing'=>'Ulashishda davom etish','Last'=>'Oxirgi','Last license'=>'Oxirgi litsenziya','Last Updated'=>'Oxirgi marta yangilangan','Latest Free Version Installed'=>'Eng so‘nggi bepul versiya o‘rnati