ining oldini olishga hamda %s qaysi tillar va mintaqalarga tarjima qilinishi va moslashtirilishi kerakligini aniqlashga yordam beradi.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Shuning uchun %s faol bo\'lmaganda litsenziyani qayta ishlatishingiz mumkin.','Subscription'=>'Obuna','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlarini tekshirish hamda litsenziyangiz haqiqiyligini tasdiqlash uchun vaqti-vaqti bilan %2$sga muhim litsenziya maʼlumotlarini yuborib turadi.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'%2$s dan %1$s mavjud.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'O‘rnatilgan plaginlar va themelar bilan moslikni ta\'minlash va ziddiyatlarning oldini olish uchun.','Trial'=>'Sinov muddati','View %s State'=>'%s holatini ko\'rish','View Basic %s Info'=>'Asosiy %s maʼlumotlarini koʻrish','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ha, sinov, steyjing yoki dasturlash maqsadida %2$s bu %4$s nusxasidir.','You have a %s license.'=>'Sizda %s litsenziya mavjud.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Siz %s litsenziyasini sotib oldingiz.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'%1$s uchun tasdiqlovchi xat %2$s manzilidagi pochta qutingizga kelishi kerak. %3$s uchun iltimos, ushbu xatdagi tugmani bosganingizga ishonch hosil qiling.','days'=>'kun','deactivating'=>'faoliyatsizlashtirilmoqda','hour'=>'soat','hours'=>'soat','license'=>'litsenziya','optional'=>'ixtiyoriy','products'=>'Mahsulotlar','skip'=>'oʻtkazib yuborish','subscription'=>'obuna','trial'=>'Sinov muddati','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Mahsulotlar','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','as software license