ing.','This setting is on or off.'=>'Bu sozlama yoqilgan yoki oʻchirilgan.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Qidiruv tizimlaridan tarjima qilinmagan sahifalarni yashirish Tranzly Pro tarkibiga kiradi.','Language switcher'=>'Tilni o\'zgartirgich','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'Tillar','Languages (side by side)'=>'Tillar (yonma-yon)','Add to Menu'=>'Menuga qoʻshish','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'Saytingizda bu element sayt tillarini ko‘rsatadi, ularning har biri joriy sahifaga shu tilda havola beradi.','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'Har bir tilingizdagi ushbu sahifaga havolalar.','Language name'=>'Til nomi','Language code'=>'Til kodi','Name and code'=>'Nomi va kodi','Design'=>'Dizayn','Show each language as'=>'Har bir tilni quyidagicha ko\'rsatish:','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'Bayroqlarni ko\'rsatish (bayroq tilni emas, mamlakatni bildiradi)','List'=>'Ro\'yxat','Pills'=>'Tugmalar','Buttons'=>'Tugmalar','Dropdown'=>'Ochiladigan menyu','Language codes'=>'Til kodlari','Flags'=>'Bayroqchalar','Include the current language'=>'Joriy tilni kiritish','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ushbu sahifa tarjima qilinmagan tillarni yashirish','Stack vertically'=>'Vertikal ravishda joylashtirish','Accessible label'=>'Ochiq yorliq','Text'=>'Matn','Background'=>'Fon','Current language text'=>'Joriy til matni','Current language background'=>'Joriy til muhiti','Border'=>'Chegara','Corner radius'=>'Burchak radiusi','Space between languages'=>'Tillклар orasidagi bo\'shliq','Text size'=>'Matn o\'lchami','Switcher'=>'Almashtirgich','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Zinn Digital® Ltd kompaniyasi bosh direktori Neil Lock tomonidan yaratilgan','Version %s'=>'Versiya %s','Tranzly website'=>'Tranzly veb-sayti','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® veb-sayti','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Pro rejalar va narxlarni ko\'rish','Languages'=>'Tillar','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Birinchi til — kontentingiz yozilgan til. Tashrif buyuruvchilar tilni almashtirish bloki yordamida o‘tishadi.','(default)'=>'(standart)','Locale code'=>'Til kodi','For example fr_FR'=>'Masalan fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Ism (ixtiyoriy)','For example Français'=>'Masalan Français','Add language'=>'Til qo\'shish','Front-end output'=>'Old tomon chiqishi','Class name prefix'=>'Klass nomi prefiksi','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Plagin sahifalaringizda chop etadigan har bir klass nomi shu prefiks bilan boshlanadi, shunda sahifalar qaysi plagin tomonidan yaratilganini oshkor qilmaydi. Harf bilan boshlanadigan 1 dan 8 gacha bo\'lgan kichik harflar yoki raqamlar.','Beta updates'=>'Beta yangilanishlar','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Bu sayt yangilanish sifatida beta-versiyalarni qabul qiladi.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ushbu sayt faqat barqaror versiyalarni qabul qiladi.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Buni Hisob sahifasida o\'zgartiring','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Beta versiyalar o\'z hisobiga ulangan litsenziyaga ega Pro o\'rnatishlariga taklif etiladi. Ulangandan so\'ng, Hisob sahifasidan qo\'shilishingiz mumkin.','Save settings'=>'Sozlamalarni saqlash','First engine that is set up'=>'Oʻrnatilgan birinchi dvigatel','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'Kalit saqlandi. U shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va boshqa hech qachon ko\'rsatilmaydi.','Engine settings saved.'=>'Dvigatel sozlamalari saqlandi.','Glossary saved.'=>'Glossariy saqlandi.','Your keys'=>'Sizning kalitlaringiz','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly tarjima xizmatlarini o\'zingizning hisobingiz orqali chaqiradi. Kalitlar ma\'lumotlar bazangizda shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va faqat o\'zlari tegishli bo\'lgan xizmatga yuboriladi. Sun\'iy intellekt modeli kalitlari sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida belgilanadi.','%s API key'=>'%s API kaliti','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'Saqlandi: %s. Uni almashtirish uchun yangi kalit kiriting yoki uni olib tashlash uchun maydonni bo\'sh qoldirib saqlang.','No key saved.'=>'Hech qanday kalit saqlanmagan.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Azure mintaqasi (global resurs uchun bo\'sh qoldiring)','Save key'=>'Kalitni saqlash','Check my DeepL usage'=>'DeepL foydalanishimni tekshirish','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'Joriy toʻlov davrida %2$s ta belgidan %1$s tasi ishlatildi.','Which engine translates'=>'Qaysi dvigatel tarjima qiladi','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Hali hech qanday dvigatel sozlanmagan. Tarjimani boshlash uchun yuqorida kalitni saqlang (yoki sun\'iy intellekt modelini sozlang).','Default engine'=>'Standart dvigatel','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Har bir til uchun alohida tarjima dvigateli, avtomatik zaxira va oylik xarajatlar limiti Tranzly Pro funksiyalaridir.','Engine for %s'=>'%s uchun dvigatel','The default engine'=>'Standart dvigatel','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Agar biron-bir dvigatel ishdan chiqsa yoki limitga yetsa, quyidagilarni shu tartibda sinab ko\'ring','Monthly spending caps'=>'Oylik xarajatlar limiti','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Dvigatel o\'z limitiga yetganda, keyingi oyga qadar unga boshqa hech narsa yuborilmaydi va tarjima xatosi hisobotida nima sababdanligi ko\'rsatiladi. Limit qo\'ymaslik uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (shu oyda sarflangan: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Saqlash hajm chegaralari','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Glossariy va hech qachon tarjima qilinmaydigan so‘zlar','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Ushbu soʻzlarni hech qachon tarjima qilmang (har bir qatorda bittadan)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Brend va mahsulot nomlari har bir dvigatel uchun aynan o\'zicha qoladi.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Afzal ko\'rilgan tarjimalar va ohang tillar bo\'yicha Tranzly Pro funksiyalari hisoblanadi.','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Afzal koʻrilgan tarjimalar (har bir qatorda bittadan: atama = tarjima)','Formality'=>'Rasmiylik','Default'=>'Standart','Formal'=>'Rasmiy','Informal'=>'Norasmiy','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Uslub ko\'rsatmalari (auditoriya, brend ovozi)','Save glossary'=>'Glossariyni saqlash','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'Bajarilishi kerak bo\'lgan %d ta tarjima bilan vazifa boshlandi. U fonda ishlaydi: bu sahifani yopishingiz mumkin.','Queued again.'=>'Qaytadan navbatga qoʻshildi.','Running'=>'Ishlamoqda','Finished'=>'Yakunlandi','Translate in the background'=>'Orqa fonda tarjima qilish','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Avval "Dvigatel" yorlig\'ida tarjima dvigatelini sozlang.','Translate every'=>'Har birini tarjima qilish','Into'=>'Ichiga','With'=>'Bilan','Each language’s own engine'=>'Har bir tilning oʻziga xos mexanizmi','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Tarjikalarni chop eting (aks holda ular qoralama sifatida saqlanadi)','Estimate the cost'=>'Narxni hisoblash','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'%1$d ta post, %2$s ta belgi. Bu dvigatelning narxi oldindan ma\'lum emas.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'%1$d ta post, %2$s ta belgi: o\'z hisobingizda taxminan $%3$s.','Start translating'=>'Tarjimani boshlash','Jobs'=>'Vazifalar','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Hozircha tarjima vazifalari yo‘q.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Vazifa %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d / %2$d tarjima qilindi, %3$d tasi bajarilmadi, %4$d tasi oʻtkazib yuborildi (himoyalangan yoki allaqachon shu tilda mavjud)','Stop this job'=>'Ushbu vazifani to\'xtatish','See what failed and why'=>'Nima muvaffaqiyatsiz bo\'lganini va nima uchunligini ko\'ring','Content'=>'Kontent','Language'=>'Til','What went wrong'=>'Nima xato ketdi','Fix it'=>'Tuzatish','Retry with'=>'Qaytadan urinish:','The same engine'=>'Xuddi shu dvigatel','Retry'=>'Qaytadan urinish','Translate by hand'=>'Qo\'lda tarjima qilish','Menus saved.'=>'Menular saqlandi.','%d texts translated.'=>'%d ta matn tarjima qilindi.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'Saqlandi. Tuzatishlaringiz mashina tarjimasidan himoyalangan.','The same menu, translated'=>'Bir xil menyu, tarjima qilingan','A separate menu per language'=>'Har bir til uchun alohida menyu','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Odatiy bo‘yicha har bir menyu tarjima qilinadi: uning havolalari o‘z sarlavhalari bilan tarjima qilingan sahifalarga olib boradi. Buning o‘rniga bu yerda har bir til uchun alohida menyuni tanlang.','Shared text'=>'Umumiy matn','Which text'=>'Qaysi matn','Menu labels'=>'Menyu yorliqlari','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Shablonlar, sarlavhalar, quyi qism va namunalar','Templates, headers, footers and patterns (Pro)'=>'Shablonlar, sarlavhalar, ostbaxshlar va naqshlar (Pro)','Translate the missing text'=>'Yetishmayotgan matnni tarjima qilish','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Bu yerda tarjima qilish uchun matn yo\'q.','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Odam tomonidan tuzatilgan, himoyalangan','Save corrections'=>'O‘zgarishlarni saqlash','Languages and settings'=>'Tillar va sozlamalar','Engines'=>'Dvigatellar','Translation jobs'=>'Tarjima vazifalari','Addresses and SEO'=>'Manzil va SEO','Language switchers'=>'Tilni o\'zgartirgichlar','SEO audit'=>'SEO audit','Menus and shared text'=>'Menyular va umumiy matn','No meta description'=>'Meta-tavsif yo‘q','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar ochib bo\'lmaydigan til versiyasi (qoralama, shaxsiy yoki parol bilan himoyalangan)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Manzil hali ham asl so‘zlardan foydalanmoqda','Still holds the original text'=>'Asl matnni saqlab qoladi','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Ko‘p tilli SEO audit Tranzly Pro tarkibiga kiradi. U har bir til bo‘yicha yetishmayotgan meta tavsiflarini, buzilgan hreflang’larni, tarjima qilinmagan manzillarni va takroriy kontentni aniqlaydi.','Language to audit'=>'Tekshiriladigan til','Run the audit'=>'Auditni bajarish','Check the next pages'=>'Keyingi sahifalarni tekshiring','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'%1$d ta sahifa tekshirildi, %2$d ta muammo topildi.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'Butun til tekshirib chiqildi.','Page'=>'Sahifa','Problem'=>'Muammo','Edit'=>'Tahrirlash','Floating switcher'=>'Suhbatni boshqaruvchi o‘tish tugmasi','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Har qanday mavzuda, sozlashlarsiz, har bir sahinaning burchagida kichik tugma.','Where'=>'Qayerda','Off'=>'O‘chiq','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Pastki burchak, oxirgi tomon','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Pastqi burchak, boshlanish tomoni','Top corner, end side'=>'Yuqori burchak, oxirgi tomon','Top corner, start side'=>'Yuqori burchak, boshlanish tomoni','Switcher around the content'=>'Kontent atrofidagi o\'tkazgich','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Har bir post va sahifaga almashtirgich qo\'shish','Before the content'=>'Kontentdan oldin','After the content'=>'Kontentdan keyin','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Boshqa almashtirgich qo\'shish usullari','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Blok muharriri va sayt muharriri: beshta dizaynga ega "Tilni almashtirgich" bloki.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: “Language switcher” elementi.','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Menyular: Tashqi ko‘rinish → Menyular → “Tilni o‘zgartirgich” katakchasi.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Yon panellar: “Tilni almashtirgich” vidjeti.','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Boshqa istalgan joyda, qisqa kod:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor va Bricks: har bir konstruktordagi “Tilni almashtirgich” vidjeti.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Elementor va Bricks vidjetlari Tranzly Pro tarkibiga kiradi.','Save'=>'Saqlash','(Pro)'=>'(Pro)','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Har bir til uchun bitta papka: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Har bir til uchun bitta kichik domen: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Har bir til uchun alohida domen: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'So\'rov parametri: example.com/?lang=de (eski saytlar)','Category'=>'Kategoriya','Tag'=>'Teg','Product'=>'Mahsulot','Product category'=>'Mahsulot toifasi','Product tag'=>'Mahsulot tegi','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'Saqlandi. Til manzillaringiz quyida ko\'rsatilganidek o\'zgartirildi.','Language in the address'=>'Manzildagi til','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar va qidiruv tizimlari har bir tilga qanday erishishi','Address word for %s'=>'%s uchun manzil so\'zi','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Standart tilda manzillarida hech qanday so‘z yo‘q.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'%s uchun domen (ixtiyoriy)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Avval domenni ushbu saytga yo\'naltiring. Domensiz til asosiy domeningizdagi papkadan foydalanadi.','Where each language lives now'=>'Har bir til hozir qayerda yashaydi','Translated address words'=>'Tarjima qilingan manzil so\'zlari','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Sahifa va post manzillari ularning tarjima qilingan savarlaridan kelib chiqadi. Bu yerda siz o\'zgarmas so\'zlarni tarjima qilasiz, shuning uchun /de/category/ o\'rniga /de/kategorie/ ishlatiladi.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (hozirda “%2$s”)','Search engines and visitors'=>'Qidiruv tizimlari va tashrif buyuruvchilar','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarga kichik banner yordamida oʻz tillarini taklif qiling (hech qachon yoʻnaltirish emas)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Qidiruv tizimlaridan tarjima qilinmagan sahifalarni yashirish (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Asl matnni o\'z ichida saqlab turgan tarjima tarjima qilinmaguncha qidiruv natijalaridan chiqarib tashlanadi.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Tranzly Pro\'ning bir qismi.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly hreflang havolalarini (x-default bilan), sahifa tili va yo‘nalishini hamda har bir tilni sayt xaritangizga qo‘shadi:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Birgalikda ishlayotgan hamkor: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Har bir manzil soʻzi 2 tadan 12 tagacha kichik harflar, raqamlar yoki defislardan iborat boʻlishi kerak.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'Saqlandi. O\'zgartirgan qismlaringiz shaxs tomonidan tekshirilgan deb belgilandi va bu tarjima mashina tarjimasidan himoyalandi.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'Ushbu tarjimaning tartibi muharrirda o\'zgartirildi, shuning uchun ba\'zi qismlar endi asl nusxaga mos kelmaydi. Juftsiz qismlar bo\'sh ko\'rsatilgan; qolganlarini muharrirda tahrirlang.','Open the editor'=>'Muharrirni ochish','Original (%s)'=>'Asl nusxa (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Tarjima (%s)','Save changes'=>'O\'zgarishlarni saqlash','Open in the editor'=>'Muharrirda ochish','Machine translated'=>'Avtomatik tarjima qilingan','Checked by a person'=>'Odam tomonidan tekshirilgan','Imported'=>'Import qilindi','Not translated yet'=>'Hali tarjima qilinmagan','Not in the translation'=>'Tarjimada yoʻq','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Boshqaruv menyusida Tranzly ostida ikkinchi tilni qo\'shing va o\'tkazgich shu yerda paydo bo\'ladi.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Standart bo\'yicha o\'chirilgan: bayroq bu til emas, balki mamlakat.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Ekran o\'quvchilari nima e\'lon qilishi, masalan, "Tilni tanlang".','Colours'=>'Rangлар','Not translated'=>'Tarjima qilinmagan','Original'=>'Asl nusxa','Published'=>'Nashr qilingan','Draft'=>'Qoralama','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Odam tomonidan tekshirilgan, himoyalangan','Imported, protected'=>'Import qilingan, himoyalangan','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Hali tarjima qilinmagan (nusxasi)','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Avval bu xabarni saqlang, keyin uni bu yerda tarjima qiling.','Side by side'=>'Yonma-yon','View'=>'Ko‘rish','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Qaytadan tarjima qilinishi uchun qulfdan chiqaring','Protect'=>'Himoyalash','Publish the translations'=>'Tarjimalarni nashr qilish','Translate into %d language'=>'%d ta tilga tarjima qilish' . "\0" . '%d ta tilga tarjima qilish','%s: translated.'=>'%s: tarjima qilindi.','Show this block'=>'Ushbu blokni ko\'rsatish','In every language'=>'Har bir tilda','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Faqat belgilangan tillarda','In every language except those ticked'=>'Belgilanganlardan tashqari har bir tilda','Image per language'=>'Har bir til uchun rasm','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'O‘quvchilarga boshqa tilda boshqa rasmni, masalan, ustida yozuvi bor bannerni ko‘rsatish.','Replace the %s image'=>'%s rasmini almashtirish','Choose a %s image'=>'%s tasvirini tanlang','Use the original image'=>'Asl rasmdan foydalanish','Correct this translation'=>'Tarjimani to\'g\'rilang','Saving…'=>'Saqlanmoqda...','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Tarjima qilingan matn. Uni to‘g‘rilash uchun Enter tugmasini bosing.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Tarjimasini tuzatish uchun istalgan belgilangan matnni bosing.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'Bu sahifada tahrirlash uchun tarjima qilingan matn topilmadi. Buning o\'rniga yonma-yon muharrirdan foydalaning.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Tilni o\'zgartirgich','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Saytning har bir tilidagi ushbu sahifaga havolalar. Ikki yoki undan ortiq tillar ko\'rsatilmaguncha u hech narsa ko\'rsatmaydi.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Til','block keywordswitcher'=>'almashtirgich','block keywordtranslation'=>'tarjima','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarga bu sahifani boshqa tilingizda o‘qish imkonini beradi: ro‘yxat, tugmalar, ochiladigan menyu yoki til kodlari, ixtiyoriy ravishda bayroqlar bilan.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'ko\'p tilli']];